  "details": "Unity 2022 with an AMD GPU causes SteamVR to crash upon reconnecting the headset.  \n\nI have tested extensively with both wired and vive wireless adapter, 2 different AMD GPU's and even downgrading to a pre 2.0 version of SteamVR (Since unity 2022 and Steamvr 2.0 released at the same time)\n\nI can supply detailed logs from both SteamVR and VRChat when this issue occurs, I will just need to know where to send these logs to.\n\nThis issue mostly appears when using Vive Wireless as its prone to accidental disconnects or disconnects when swapping batteries, but also exists on wired vive headsets if they are reconnected.\n\n- Tested on Intel CPU's with vega 64 ad intel CPU's with rx 5700xt.  = Crashed\n\n- Tested on AMD CPU's with 7900xt = No problem\n\n- Tested on rx 500 series = no problem",
